---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="yaopulife Terms of Service - General terms for site use and custom phone case requests.">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500">Last updated: June 22, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-12 prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using yaopulife.com, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">2. Custom Requests &amp; Quotes</h2>
        <p>yaopulife offers made-to-order custom phone cases. Product pages are inquiry and quote pages, not automated checkout pages. A request submitted through the site is reviewed, and the final price, production timeline, shipping, taxes, payment method, and refund terms are confirmed in a written quote or invoice before any payment is made or any item is produced.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">3. Pricing &amp; Payment</h2>
        <p>This site has no automated online checkout. Prices shown on product pages are base prices for the personalized item; shipping, taxes, and any phone-model-specific changes are additional and are confirmed in a written quote or invoice before payment. No payment is collected through this website.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>You warrant that any images or content you provide for customization do not infringe on third-party intellectual property rights. We reserve the right to refuse designs that violate copyright or trademark.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, yaopulife is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages related to use of the site or preliminary custom request review.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@yaopulife.com" class="text-brand-600">hello@yaopulife.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
